model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-03-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.8 §4 item 58 (#169-e): a window's reads are decided only where every day agrees: flows over a span a movement's window crosses the end of is HOLE-IMPRECISE (fd; refcore prints a value before 2.1.8), its windows each splits (fd_each); one wholly inside answers (fin)"

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input wd: date

move g: transfers
  on wd
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  amt = 10.00 PLN "s"
  wd = window(2026-12-20, 2027-01-10) "s"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask fd: flows(konto, 2026-12-01 .. 2026-12-31)
ask fd_each_s1: flows(konto, 2026-12-01 .. 2026-12-31) with wd = 2026-12-20

ask fd_each_s2: flows(konto, 2026-12-01 .. 2026-12-31) with wd = 2027-01-01
ask fin: flows(konto, 2026-12-01 .. 2027-01-31)
